       Short: VERY powerfull BBS filelist generator.
    Uploader: anthony@backyard.demon.co.uk
      Author: anthony@backyard.demon.co.uk
        Type: comm/bbs
     Version: 1.0
    Requires: WB1.3+ - Any bulletin board software.
Distribution: Shareware

BlitzList is a fast file listing program which uses the file comments of the
files in the directories configured with the config file specified, and is
probably about as fast as a filelister can actually get. It also has options
to use file_id.diz extraction routines for file descriptions.

# Ideal for script work

# Supports text and AmigaGuide filelists

# Generated filelists create .REQ files

# Will work with any (YES ANY) bulletin board software

# A heap of example config files

# '            '    script and arexx files

# Built in detailed configuration check and display

# Supports generating newfile lists

# Ansi and spacing control configurable

# File_ID.diz and .readme usage for file descriptions

# Afterlist commands for working with generated filelists

# Unlimited directories. All filelists could be generated from one config file!

* Blitzlist is shareware - please support Amiga development if you like it.

